    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1052">

                <pb facs="0945" n="841" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg841"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/9229.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to
                            Panama to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-10-16T10:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 16, 1913—10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s October 14, 7 p.m. President Porras cordially approves the attitude
                    of the United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
